# Canonical development entry point. `nix develop` in flake.nix is a convenience,
# not the supported environment.
#
# Entering the shell does not build the library; `outputs` are lazy.
# devenv.lock is the driver's to write.
#
#   devenv build outputs.static   # the SDK's own linkage policy
#   devenv build outputs.shared   # -Dlinkage=dynamic
#   devenv tasks                  # sdk:build, sdk:test, sdk:check, ...
#
# Scratch, cache and runtime-socket variables come from the caller. Nothing here
# sets or unsets them.
use devenv
